--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications by Kontell
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is a fork, maintained at https://github.com/kontell/script.embuary.info.
It keeps the upstream add-on id `script.embuary.info` so that it upgrades an
existing install in place; it is not endorsed by or affiliated with the
original author. Please report issues against the Kontell repository.

Section 4(b) of the License requires that modified files carry prominent
notice of the changes. The whole tree is modified relative to upstream (it was
reformatted with black), so rather than annotate every file, the substantive
changes are recorded here and in changelog.txt:

  * Forked from the upstream `matrix` branch at 2.0.10 (commit f4e1f02), which
    is 20 commits beyond the released 2.0.8 and was never published.
  * Bounded the dialog stack and cache in resources/lib/main.py. Upstream kept
    every visited page resident in `dialog_cache`, `window_stack` and the
    recursion frames of `dialog_manager`, so a long browsing session grew
    without limit until the OS killed Kodi.
  * Artwork URLs now request a TMDb size variant appropriate to the target,
    rather than `original` for everything.
  * Reduced page-load latency: a shared requests.Session, parallel and
    time-bounded YouTube trailer checks, indexed local-library matching, and
    the removal of several quadratic loops.
  * Fixed defects in helper.date_year() (UnboundLocalError), the inverted
    `show_error` test in tmdb.tmdb_query(), and duplicated de_DE metadata in
    addon.xml.
  * Replaced upstream's GitHub Actions with the Kontell add-on CI shape, and
    removed addon-submitter.yml, which submitted releases to the official Kodi
    add-on repository.
